Subject: [PATCH 6.18.y] drm/xe/guc_ads: allocate UM queues in a separate BO
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 16:08:37 +0000
Message-ID: <20260820160837.1333486-1-jia.yao@intel.com>
